WEBVTT

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:08.150
I did kill people,

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.860
but that's why I'll protect you.

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:11.400
Insania.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.030
Stop!

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:15.700
Tei!

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:19.910
That's not what you would do.

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:22.770
We should get raw data from the larva.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.330
Destroy Epsilon.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:30.460
We met in the dream.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.650
This isn't a mission.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:37.850
It's a hunt to kill every single one of them!

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:41.310
Run, Quon!

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:59.550
Quon!

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.790
Do you know what you've done?!

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:13.920
You caused an explosion in the middle of the city!

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:16.720
The Director General of the Defense Agency will lose his job!

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:20.760
In fact, even the government itself is at risk!

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:23.810
Say something! Kamishiro-kun!

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:30.060
A man of Custos only gives explanations to Ordo.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.770
Wh-What?

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:36.780
Ordo's Council of Kings approved the operation.

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:40.070
I don't care whether Ordo approved it.

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:41.700
The matter puts the nation's political—

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.340
That's enough.

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:44.500
Sir...

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.430
You're only concerned about Japan.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:50.080
Ordo's concerns span the entire world,

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:53.080
and the Council of Kings decided accordingly.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:54.460
We're not permitted to question it.

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.010
B-But, sir...

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:58.090
How will we explain this to the people?

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:01.010
Terrorists were about to attack?

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:03.410
I don't know. You figure it out!

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:07.430
All personnel of the Ministry of Defense,
including the minister, will have to resign.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:09.520
S-Sir!

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:13.190
I'll let this go as a favor to Ordo.

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:15.730
Ordo doesn't owe favors to anyone.

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:19.200
Then Kamishiro, this will be a favor to you.

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:23.330
I've heard that there's an open seat on the Board of Twelve.

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.890
I believe you've been misinformed.

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:29.960
There are no open seats.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:48.180
Sign: It's safe from here on out

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.600
I-I see.

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:07.080
The Fantasium Garden... is gone.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.120
Ow...

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:16.800
Are you okay?

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:51.830
Yuuma, you...

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:57.960
Is this my... power?

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:01.800
You're... a lot more than just bubbles!

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:07.250
We don't have any time to waste.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.890
We need to rendezvous with everyone else.

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:14.360
We'll be climbing a long way from here.

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.500
Quon-sama, Shun-san...

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.900
Don't worry about him.

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:31.700
There's no way he's dead.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:46.390
Chapter 5 ｢A Heroic Return」

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:11.290
Epsilon?

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:16.090
Yes, he knocked out one of our investigators and ran away.

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:19.290
We chased him with the cameras, but we lost him.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:24.060
He survived the explosion? In his messed-up condition?

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:25.550
What a waste.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:29.760
If he'd stayed on the network, I could've obtained valuable data.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:42.040
Shun...

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.470
Is everyone asleep?

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:19.440
They walked and climbed so much today.

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:23.070
They all fell asleep from fatigue.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.680
Today was a busy day.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:30.220
Kannazuki-san, who is this?

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:32.070
Oh, she's Sanada-san.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.710
She helped a lot with starting the Fantasium Garden.

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:37.730
An old friend.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:43.630
Don't worry. She knows what we are.

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:44.920
Are you going somewhere?

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.800
Well, I have to figure something out.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.090
We can't do anything the way we are now.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:51.050
Oh, going somewhere?

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.630
I'm heading out for a bit.

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:58.100
I'm heading out for a bit!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:02.690
Oh. Sure, stay safe.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.540
I'm leaving you guys in charge here.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.660
Where did Epsilon go?

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:20.200
We lost him, but we'll find him soon.

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:22.290
He doesn't have many places to hide.

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:24.380
If we send in WTOC...

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.090
We'll let the Operations Team handle it.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:26.670
But...

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:30.050
We didn't find any corpses in the amusement park.

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:35.470
We need WTOC to eliminate the supernaturals still in hiding.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.810
Understood.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.480
Board member Kannazuki?

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:54.030
Kamishiro-kun, it's been a while.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:58.030
What's a member of the Board doing here?

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:03.290
Does a member of Ordo need a reason to come to one of its subordinate organizations?

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:19.540
Would you like anything to drink?

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.520
Did you know?

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:32.320
Because of one foreigner born with a mutation, 10% of Japanese can't decompose alcohol.

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:36.930
I digress.

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:41.440
You took rather drastic measures, blowing up an urban area.

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:44.460
How many of them did you exterminate?

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:46.320
None.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:53.170
But we managed to destroy their hideout.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:57.140
You talk big for a man who's done so little.

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:00.580
The Council of Kings approved the mission,

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:04.890
so you're in no position to say anything. You're just a member of the Board.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.320
Did you fail to capture Insania?

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:22.440
I don't need to answer you, but I'm sure you'd love to know.

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:24.700
Alpha confirmed his death.

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:27.580
Quon... is dead?

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:29.820
Is something wrong?

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:30.790
No.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:31.720
His corpse?

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:36.050
We believe his body was incinerated in the explosion.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.180
Sorry. My fingers slipped.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.860
I must ask you.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:55.900
Why are you so interested in Insania all of a sudden?

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:59.240
Ordo keeps the world in order.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:03.540
Because of what we do, people can look forward to tomorrow in peace.

00:10:04.190 --> 00:10:06.290
This is necessary to achieve that goal.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:09.530
I don't need to explain it to you.

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:12.170
So you have the Council of Kings' approval?

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:17.580
I'll take your silence as a no.

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:25.180
I could report your absence to the Council of Kings.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.180
Oh, they know.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:30.300
But they can't remove me.

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:33.320
Oh? And why is that?

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:36.070
I don't think I need to answer you.

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:43.910
But perhaps I should report to the Council that under your leadership,

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:47.670
Custos has changed its objective from extermination to capture.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:49.580
I have their approval.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:54.840
Do they also know that the supernaturals' shelter is empty?

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.090
Don't underestimate the Board.

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:01.470
Where in the world did they go?

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:06.560
Or so I could say, but what happens to those creatures is not my concern.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:13.730
However, I'm very interested in the current operation.

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:17.190
After all, we're dealing with a lot of them.

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:18.980
That's...

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:38.240
Board member Kannazuki, I'd like to ask <i>you some questions this time.</i>

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:46.550
Everyone's so energetic.

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:50.560
I wonder where the old man went.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:58.320
What should we do now?

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:02.300
What <i>can we do?</i>

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:05.840
Our only choice, probably, is to remain here for a while.

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:07.450
I wonder how long we can stay.

00:12:08.150 --> 00:12:12.690
We've really relied too much on Kannazuki-san.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.150
Oh, man!

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.840
Now even Quon had to die.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:18.690
Taka-bou!

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.720
You all think he's dead too, right?

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.760
Quon is invincible.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:27.940
He's been in terrible danger before, but he's always come back.

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:30.290
Then why isn't he here?!

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:37.610
Stupid Quon!

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:43.790
Do you know the identity of the parent company for the Fantasium Garden amusement park?

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:44.740
No.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:51.250
After going through multiple bogus companies, we ultimately get to a company named K&N.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:56.250
K&N was also involved in the Shinagawa incident the other day.

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:59.150
Where that explosion happened.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:06.050
Board member Kannazuki, it's your company, is it not?

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:07.890
That's ridiculous.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:11.850
Co-CEO Nagatomo gave us your name.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:14.810
What? What did you do to him?!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:17.350
We're not restricted by the Geneva Convention.

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:21.020
No one will penalize us for using torture.

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:29.080
Kannazuki-san.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:33.040
I'd like to hear your story in detail.

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:40.720
If Quon did die...

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:41.750
No!

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:44.870
No, Wakatsuki-san is right.

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:47.420
We should assume the worst-case scenario.

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:49.260
If Quon is gone...

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:50.720
I don't want to think about it!

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.180
I don't want to believe he's dead!

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:59.500
I think I'll leave.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:04.250
After all, the Fantasium Garden is gone, and so is Quon.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:06.750
So we don't need to be together.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:10.880
I want to go home once.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:14.080
I want to meet my parents after giving them so much trouble.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:15.490
Takao.

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:17.610
Sorry!

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:18.210
I...

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:21.460
I'll stay here.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.840
There's nothing for me at the orphanage.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:29.290
I don't want to think about this, but if Quon isn't coming back,

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:32.440
then I'll start a community like the Garden.

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:33.430
Yuri...

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.780
I mean, it was fun.

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:39.300
We all played and laughed together.

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:43.690
Yeah! We can all work together and—

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:45.680
But is that the right thing to do?

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:50.490
It's always been on my mind, but was the Garden right?

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.370
Wh-What are you saying?

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:53.920
Think about it.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:58.100
You're hiding from the public, and you can't even go home.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:14:59.330
Is that right?

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.920
I definitely don't think it was wrong!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:06.220
I'm not saying it was wrong.

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:09.660
Still, perhaps it's time to start thinking about...

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:11.470
leaving the Garden.

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:25.570
Your talk with the Board member?

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.830
It was worthwhile.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:30.900
Status on Epsilon?

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:35.990
Despite the damage he sustained, he's managed to slip past the Operations Team.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:39.530
It's a real bummer that he was disconnected.

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:42.250
Very well. Then let's use WTOC.

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:21.410
S-Stop!

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.290
Fire!

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.570
Stop, Epsilon.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:37.830
Surrender.

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:40.810
Hizuru?

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:42.810
Epsilon.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:47.990
Hizuru, the people we're hunting aren't monsters.

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:49.900
They're normal children.

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.730
They laugh and they play.

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:54.070
What crap is this? They're monsters.

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:56.330
Monsters?

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:01.200
"Monster" refers to someone like me.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:08.460
If I return to Custos, I'll be turned into a lab rat.

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:10.460
Shun...

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:12.960
What will you do to me?

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:20.350
We've been ordered to bring you in.

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:22.230
Hizuru.

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:24.200
So...

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.770
you leave me no choice.

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:52.300
Stop!

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:00.780
Shun...

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:07.160
Try and catch me!

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:09.480
Hey! Give it back! It's mine!

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:15.610
I can't do it.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:16.610
Do what?

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:20.620
It went well that time, but I can only make bubbles.

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.830
You were practicing?

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:27.080
Make sure to fill the cup with tea.

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.420
To the very top.

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:35.130
So full that another drop would make it overflow.

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:42.690
I had a dream.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:45.060
My mom was crying.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:47.330
She wanted to see me.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:49.980
Quon-san's gone,

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:51.940
and Kannazuki-san's not coming back.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:55.460
I wonder what's gonna happen to us.

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:57.900
Hey, do you know where Tei and Kiri are?

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:59.200
They went out.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.030
Out? Where?

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:05.460
Kiri wanted to see her grandma, so Tei went with her.

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:10.290
I finished the laundry.

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:11.830
Thank you.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.840
I feel much better now.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.750
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:21.130
Don't worry. I just want you to be happy.

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:23.930
My body's gotten so weak...

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.180
and I've only made you worry.

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:30.130
I'm so sorry.

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:31.940
No, it's fine.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:33.630
I'm sorry!

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:39.360
Tei-san, was it?

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:42.480
Please be good to her.

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:46.580
I'll be fine. I have a helper coming.

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:50.250
What she needs right now are friends.

00:19:51.070 --> 00:19:52.330
Grandma...

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:57.550
Do be a good friend to her, Tei-san.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:59.090
Of course.

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:04.590
She's a very nice grandma.

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:11.770
Stay calm.

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:18.320
Excuse me. May I see your ID?

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:20.940
Hi, how's it going?

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:30.750
All green.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:31.580
She's certified.

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:33.790
Sorry to have stopped you.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:35.250
Not at all.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.490
Let's go.

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:38.790
Excuse us.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:41.050
I don't know how long it'll last.

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.080
Don't run. We'll turn at the next corner.

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:44.290
Okay.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.050
A-All red!

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:49.620
After them!

00:20:57.830 --> 00:21:02.480
Oh, no. We can't go back to where everyone is like this.

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:17.650
Kiri-san, do you think Quon-sama is really dead?

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.630
Do you think Shun-san died too?

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.220
I don't think so either.

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:28.340
Those two will definitely save us.

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:33.640
I'm going to use my power.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:37.900
We may get detected, putting us in even more danger.

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:40.070
Is that okay?

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:53.860
Quon-sama.

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:58.870
Please save us.

00:22:00.610 --> 00:22:02.030
Quon-sama.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:14.600
All the numbers look good.

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:17.720
You're back to normal. Thanks for your patience.

00:22:18.490 --> 00:22:21.890
So you failed to capture Epsilon?

00:22:21.890 --> 00:22:23.770
I'm very sorry.

00:22:23.770 --> 00:22:27.870
You can't capture Epsilon even when he's damaged.

00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:32.370
I'd prefer that you capture him rather than destroy him, so we could get his data.

00:22:32.970 --> 00:22:34.140
Capture?

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:39.170
We aren't dogs.

00:22:47.430 --> 00:22:50.010
Larva red signal detected in Shinjuku-ku Area.

00:22:50.580 --> 00:22:52.470
Send the Operations Team to isolate the area.

00:22:52.470 --> 00:22:53.580
Roger.

00:22:53.580 --> 00:22:55.310
Sending in Teams D and E.

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:21.930
Shun-san?

00:23:23.170 --> 00:23:25.380
Are you two hurt?

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:28.240
No, I'm glad you're okay.

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:29.630
What about the other children?

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:32.570
They've all been evacuated.

00:23:32.570 --> 00:23:34.210
That's good.

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:35.390
Then let's go.

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:36.890
Okay.

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:46.850
I've heard it's quite painful to be stabbed under the nails with a red hot needle.

00:23:49.340 --> 00:23:52.030
Kannazuki-san, please tell me.

00:23:52.560 --> 00:23:56.920
What are the "Tears of Time" mentioned in the Kannazuki family documents?

00:23:56.920 --> 00:24:00.040
I-I don't know what you mean.

00:24:04.760 --> 00:24:07.540
Oh? Did you break inside?

00:24:07.540 --> 00:24:08.800
How unfortunate.

00:24:09.370 --> 00:24:12.820
I don't want to continue this either.

00:24:13.630 --> 00:24:15.800
What are the Tears of Time?

00:24:16.620 --> 00:24:22.530
Of all the Board of Twelve members, why does the Kannazuki family receive discretionary power?

00:24:25.200 --> 00:24:27.610
Connections, maybe?

00:24:29.360 --> 00:24:31.900
No. Stop!

00:25:21.430 --> 00:25:25.320
Death... is catching up to me.

00:25:32.190 --> 00:25:36.630
Will this pain and suffering catch up as well someday?

00:25:40.280 --> 00:25:44.600
That's right. I fell in a hole, and...

00:25:46.180 --> 00:25:47.650
No...

00:25:49.280 --> 00:25:51.110
This can't be!

00:26:51.390 --> 00:26:52.790
May I help you?

00:26:53.830 --> 00:26:56.050
Password: Iconoclasm.

00:26:56.050 --> 00:26:57.130
Roger.

00:26:57.800 --> 00:27:00.050
Activating program Iconoclasm.

00:27:05.110 --> 00:27:06.020
What's going on?

00:27:06.020 --> 00:27:08.640
For unknown reasons, the system is shutting down.

00:27:09.100 --> 00:27:10.900
Run a high authority command.

00:27:10.900 --> 00:27:12.610
I can't. Command denied.

00:27:12.610 --> 00:27:13.270
Why?

00:27:13.270 --> 00:27:14.770
It's Iconoclasm!

00:27:15.680 --> 00:27:16.440
What?

00:27:20.530 --> 00:27:24.780
Ryou, sorry, but I'm disabling data protection.

00:27:28.250 --> 00:27:29.790
Everyone's safe.

00:27:33.560 --> 00:27:34.550
Quon!

00:27:34.990 --> 00:27:38.040
Good. He's okay.

00:27:39.000 --> 00:27:40.720
But how?

00:27:45.550 --> 00:27:47.810
Get out of there, Quon!

00:27:53.020 --> 00:27:55.560
You're quite something, Kannazuki-san.

00:28:02.660 --> 00:28:05.120
Tei! Kiri-chan!

00:28:05.120 --> 00:28:07.800
We were worried because you were so late.

00:28:07.800 --> 00:28:09.580
We thought you'd been caught.

00:28:09.580 --> 00:28:12.150
They were close, but...

00:28:12.150 --> 00:28:13.710
Someone rescued us.

00:28:18.590 --> 00:28:19.670
Shun.

00:28:20.420 --> 00:28:22.130
You decided to come back!

00:28:27.350 --> 00:28:29.620
Looks like you need to be treated again.

00:28:29.620 --> 00:28:31.430
Ryou, can you help me?

00:28:31.430 --> 00:28:32.390
Of course.

00:28:33.620 --> 00:28:36.500
I... can stay here?

00:28:36.500 --> 00:28:38.270
What are you saying?

00:28:38.270 --> 00:28:40.720
Of course you can.

00:28:40.720 --> 00:28:42.490
You're one of us.

00:28:46.870 --> 00:28:47.740
Where's Quon?

00:28:49.830 --> 00:28:52.000
So it's just you guys?

00:28:56.410 --> 00:28:57.540
I see.

00:29:07.390 --> 00:29:10.640
They look happy despite losing their home.

00:29:10.640 --> 00:29:12.820
It's because they're all together.

00:29:12.820 --> 00:29:17.150
As long as they have each other, they won't be dispirited.

00:29:20.100 --> 00:29:21.330
You're right.

00:29:26.790 --> 00:29:29.820
Quon. You can't.

00:29:29.820 --> 00:29:32.830
The Room of the Tears of Time is too...

00:29:49.680 --> 00:29:50.780
Quon!

00:29:50.780 --> 00:29:52.940
Where are you?

00:29:59.810 --> 00:30:01.320
Quon!

00:30:01.980 --> 00:30:03.490
Quon!

00:30:10.020 --> 00:30:11.280
Why?

00:30:13.380 --> 00:30:14.910
Listen to me!

00:30:15.280 --> 00:30:15.830
Why?!

00:30:23.130 --> 00:30:24.250
Seiji.

00:30:24.720 --> 00:30:26.050
Why did you keep this hidden?

00:30:27.210 --> 00:30:28.050
Quon?

00:30:28.470 --> 00:30:30.440
Why didn't you tell me?

00:30:30.440 --> 00:30:32.050
I thought we were friends!

00:30:32.050 --> 00:30:33.430
Why?!

00:30:34.680 --> 00:30:35.860
Listen to me.

00:30:35.860 --> 00:30:37.310
This is something the Kannazuki family has...

00:30:45.550 --> 00:30:49.470
Thank you for guiding me here, Kannazuki-san.

00:30:50.200 --> 00:30:51.870
Kamishiro.

00:30:51.870 --> 00:30:52.740
You!

00:30:53.310 --> 00:30:55.840
I must say, this is...

00:31:01.700 --> 00:31:02.880
Who are you?

00:31:03.870 --> 00:31:06.000
You don't disappoint, Insania.

00:31:06.000 --> 00:31:10.630
Alpha confirmed your extermination, yet here you are.

00:31:11.050 --> 00:31:14.330
Oh, I'm sorry for the late introduction.

00:31:14.330 --> 00:31:17.980
I'm Kamishiro Genji. I command Custos.

00:31:24.610 --> 00:31:27.610
Are you sure you should be fighting me?

00:31:28.990 --> 00:31:32.070
Do you know why the cyborgs aren't here?

00:31:33.030 --> 00:31:35.240
I gave them orders to hunt down the others.

00:31:35.730 --> 00:31:38.840
I sent them to the Sanada Industrial Main Building.

00:31:39.630 --> 00:31:43.250
I believe they cooperated in constructing the Fantasium Garden.

00:31:44.570 --> 00:31:45.710
Damn it, Kamishiro!

00:31:47.210 --> 00:31:49.210
Everyone's hiding there.

00:31:50.450 --> 00:31:52.720
Give the order to stop the attack!

00:31:52.720 --> 00:31:55.230
Why would I do that?

00:31:55.230 --> 00:31:57.970
I don't have any reason to stop.

00:31:59.040 --> 00:31:59.680
Quon...

00:32:03.520 --> 00:32:04.860
Leave him be.

00:32:05.750 --> 00:32:07.680
Now, Kannazuki-san.

00:32:07.680 --> 00:32:09.730
I want to know.

00:32:09.730 --> 00:32:11.860
Tell me about the Tears of Time.

00:32:31.120 --> 00:32:34.090
B-Seeker has surfaced via the Iogi junction.

00:32:45.230 --> 00:32:47.400
Time to work.

00:32:52.000 --> 00:32:55.030
Everyone! Stick close to me!

00:33:05.790 --> 00:33:08.310
What an intriguing old lady.

00:33:08.310 --> 00:33:10.000
Gamma, destroy the force field.

00:33:10.000 --> 00:33:11.120
Roger!

00:33:16.830 --> 00:33:17.550
Shun.

00:33:17.960 --> 00:33:19.760
Formation 13.

00:33:20.220 --> 00:33:22.560
What an unlucky number that is.

00:33:23.110 --> 00:33:26.480
You talk as if you have real feelings!

00:33:46.280 --> 00:33:48.460
Now, let's hear it!

00:33:48.920 --> 00:33:54.780
Because you have this, the Kannazuki family has a seat on the Board of Twelve.

00:33:54.780 --> 00:33:55.970
Am I wrong?

00:33:56.980 --> 00:33:59.470
It's none of your business.

00:33:59.930 --> 00:34:02.970
I don't think you have a choice.

00:34:07.530 --> 00:34:12.230
This is Towa, the younger brother of Quon, or Insania to you.

00:34:12.810 --> 00:34:13.860
Oh?

00:34:15.050 --> 00:34:19.160
Towa is probably the strongest supernatural in history.

00:34:19.160 --> 00:34:23.620
If he's activated, he'll cause an unfathomable tragedy.

00:34:24.160 --> 00:34:26.500
His power activated 1000 years ago.

00:34:27.250 --> 00:34:34.210
He did it to protect his friends, but he was most afraid of what his power might cause.

00:34:35.920 --> 00:34:42.550
Because of his fear about that power, he sealed himself away.

00:34:47.750 --> 00:34:54.650
Towa has been condemning himself for the past millennium, sunk in sorrow.

00:34:55.390 --> 00:34:56.650
Kamishiro.

00:34:56.650 --> 00:35:00.160
You probably think you outsmarted me getting past Iconoclasm.

00:35:00.160 --> 00:35:03.450
But... that was well within my expectations.

00:35:04.780 --> 00:35:07.830
I lured you here!

00:35:14.980 --> 00:35:17.210
The supernaturals aren't monsters.

00:35:17.210 --> 00:35:19.130
They're normal children.

00:35:24.370 --> 00:35:25.180
Shun.

00:35:32.950 --> 00:35:33.610
What's so funny?

00:35:34.260 --> 00:35:35.880
It's so ugly.

00:35:35.880 --> 00:35:40.090
You made a long speech to delay your death for just a second.

00:35:40.090 --> 00:35:43.870
If that's what you'd intended,
you would've hit the switch already.

00:35:50.080 --> 00:35:51.630
I'm sorry.

00:35:51.630 --> 00:35:55.790
I never told anyone, but I'm also a supernatural.

00:35:57.090 --> 00:35:58.300
What did you say?

00:35:58.300 --> 00:36:02.800
And my ability is a little different.

00:36:03.260 --> 00:36:07.060
I can steal other people's abilities.

00:36:27.130 --> 00:36:28.790
Of course he's not dead.

00:36:29.360 --> 00:36:31.360
What's going on?

00:36:31.360 --> 00:36:32.120
Quon?

00:36:34.130 --> 00:36:35.460
Quon-sama!

00:36:35.460 --> 00:36:37.100
Quon-sama...

00:36:37.100 --> 00:36:43.090
I've grown so old, but you haven't changed after sixty years.

00:36:43.840 --> 00:36:47.350
Your eyes are still as pretty as ever, Mayumi.

00:36:55.890 --> 00:36:57.190
Formation 7-1.

00:36:57.190 --> 00:36:58.270
Roger.

00:37:02.450 --> 00:37:04.610
Hizuru, I don't want to fight you!

00:37:07.350 --> 00:37:08.490
Hizuru.

00:37:26.410 --> 00:37:28.010
What... is this?

00:37:28.880 --> 00:37:30.280
Sh-Shun?

00:37:30.280 --> 00:37:31.390
Wow, awesome!

00:37:31.390 --> 00:37:33.120
Shun-san...

00:37:33.120 --> 00:37:35.270
Is that his max power?

00:37:35.600 --> 00:37:37.400
Alpha, instructions.

00:37:37.400 --> 00:37:39.360
Capture them, but be cautious.

00:37:47.150 --> 00:37:47.860
Shun...

00:37:48.450 --> 00:37:49.460
Don't falter!

00:38:04.850 --> 00:38:06.240
What about the kids?

00:38:06.240 --> 00:38:08.680
What did you do with the kids you hunted?

00:38:09.310 --> 00:38:10.430
You didn't!

00:38:13.480 --> 00:38:15.890
I stole this power from Saki.

00:38:22.920 --> 00:38:24.220
That's odd.

00:38:24.220 --> 00:38:26.530
I don't remember being able to burn people.

00:38:26.530 --> 00:38:27.840
No...

00:38:29.590 --> 00:38:30.950
I see!

00:38:42.580 --> 00:38:44.340
I understand now.

00:38:44.340 --> 00:38:48.210
Towa's power is to amplify other people's powers.

00:38:48.210 --> 00:38:52.890
That's why Ordo let you do whatever you pleased.

00:38:53.350 --> 00:38:55.890
The Recovery Team is on its way.

00:38:55.890 --> 00:38:58.560
Now's your chance to escape.

00:39:02.310 --> 00:39:04.440
Stop! Kamishiro!

00:39:12.240 --> 00:39:13.700
Gamma disabled.

00:39:13.700 --> 00:39:15.580
Alpha's motor output has dropped to 40%.

00:39:15.580 --> 00:39:17.980
Delta is unstable.

00:39:17.980 --> 00:39:19.410
How can this be?

00:39:23.220 --> 00:39:24.040
Quon!

00:39:25.710 --> 00:39:29.130
Delta, new instructions.

00:39:29.130 --> 00:39:29.840
Do not break.

00:39:30.230 --> 00:39:32.030
R-Roger.

00:39:32.030 --> 00:39:33.640
You've done enough.

00:39:33.640 --> 00:39:34.600
Commander!

00:39:35.990 --> 00:39:39.850
You were all just hardheaded tin dolls, after all.

00:39:39.850 --> 00:39:40.870
What?

00:39:41.630 --> 00:39:43.030
He showed up out of nowhere!

00:39:43.560 --> 00:39:45.730
Commander, why are you here?

00:39:45.730 --> 00:39:48.200
Are you in any position to question me?

00:39:48.200 --> 00:39:49.240
Retreat.

00:39:49.240 --> 00:39:50.200
But...

00:39:50.200 --> 00:39:52.500
Delta, Commander's orders.

00:39:52.500 --> 00:39:53.490
R-Roger.

00:40:01.710 --> 00:40:05.790
As an introduction, let me show you my power.

00:40:14.840 --> 00:40:16.220
Kamishiro!

00:40:17.930 --> 00:40:19.390
Granny! Get up!

00:40:19.390 --> 00:40:20.690
Granny!

00:40:20.690 --> 00:40:22.390
She's not dead.

00:40:22.390 --> 00:40:26.400
But she's lost something important as a person.

00:40:26.400 --> 00:40:27.320
You...

00:40:27.630 --> 00:40:28.870
Oh, no.

00:40:31.310 --> 00:40:33.110
Sorry for the late introduction.

00:40:33.110 --> 00:40:37.200
My power is to make other people's powers mine.

00:40:37.200 --> 00:40:40.720
Kamishiro! You're also a supernatural?!

00:40:40.720 --> 00:40:41.580
Then why?

00:40:42.000 --> 00:40:47.590
Have you ever thought about what's the purpose of your powers?

00:40:49.590 --> 00:40:53.080
Thought about why you must be oppressed?

00:40:53.080 --> 00:40:56.590
Or why the foolish weak detest you?

00:40:56.590 --> 00:40:58.930
What are you plotting?

00:40:59.450 --> 00:41:04.440
You know why I was hunting you as part of Ordo?

00:41:05.080 --> 00:41:08.110
I did it in order to save you.

00:41:08.110 --> 00:41:10.020
If you come to headquarters, you'll understand.

00:41:10.020 --> 00:41:12.940
I haven't killed anyone. It's true.

00:41:14.000 --> 00:41:15.950
Are you all okay as it is?

00:41:16.410 --> 00:41:19.400
You live in hiding, cowering in fear.

00:41:19.400 --> 00:41:21.950
Do you plan to do this until you die?

00:41:23.450 --> 00:41:25.460
Don't you want to go back home?

00:41:27.250 --> 00:41:29.460
I can see my mom.

00:41:30.980 --> 00:41:31.920
That's right.

00:41:31.920 --> 00:41:33.470
Don't be deceived!

00:41:33.470 --> 00:41:36.840
He's the one who ordered us to capture you!

00:41:39.470 --> 00:41:43.680
But I can give you a new future.

00:41:44.230 --> 00:41:48.820
Won't you grasp a new future with me?

00:41:48.820 --> 00:41:51.400
A future where you can laugh with your parents?

00:41:51.400 --> 00:41:57.410
If not, then Ordo might even kill your parents.

00:42:05.980 --> 00:42:07.970
Takao-san?

00:42:07.970 --> 00:42:09.430
Taka-bou...

00:42:10.490 --> 00:42:11.750
I'm sorry.

00:42:11.750 --> 00:42:15.140
But I want to see my mom again.

00:42:16.320 --> 00:42:20.350
If I stay with Quon, I won't be able to see her.

00:42:24.150 --> 00:42:26.020
Takao, he's lying!

00:42:26.020 --> 00:42:28.480
Mama's going to die?

00:42:28.480 --> 00:42:30.190
No, I don't want that!

00:42:30.190 --> 00:42:30.990
Mommy!

00:42:30.990 --> 00:42:31.430
Hey!

00:42:31.430 --> 00:42:32.270
I want to see my family!

00:42:31.700 --> 00:42:32.270
Guys!

00:42:35.410 --> 00:42:36.500
You there!

00:42:39.090 --> 00:42:42.200
Don't look into my heart like that.

00:42:42.200 --> 00:42:43.450
Tei!

00:42:43.450 --> 00:42:44.580
Kamishiro!

00:42:44.580 --> 00:42:46.100
Don't take the kids!

00:42:50.280 --> 00:42:51.660
Stupid Taka-bou!

00:42:52.570 --> 00:42:53.340
Quon...

00:43:01.930 --> 00:43:03.030
Everyone...

00:43:04.520 --> 00:43:05.980
I'm sorry.

00:43:12.480 --> 00:43:17.530
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:43:17.530 --> 00:43:25.740
A scream of my burning soul that seems to burst out of my chest

00:43:17.530 --> 00:43:25.540
mune no oku hajike sou na atsui tamashii no sakebi wo

00:43:25.740 --> 00:43:32.290
Burst on the fire

00:43:46.010 --> 00:43:51.140
I was struck by thunderstorm, suddenly awakening my instinct

00:43:46.010 --> 00:43:51.140
raiu ni utare totsuzen mezameta honnou

00:43:51.140 --> 00:43:55.690
It burns on, pushing aside my sensibility

00:43:51.140 --> 00:43:55.690
risei wo oshinokete moetagiru no sa

00:43:55.690 --> 00:44:00.780
The truth is written on the walls of memory

00:43:55.690 --> 00:44:00.780
kioku no kabe ni kakikomareta shinjitsu wa

00:44:00.780 --> 00:44:05.120
No one can violate it

00:44:00.780 --> 00:44:04.990
dare ni mo okasenai

00:44:05.120 --> 00:44:14.540
We have no questions; we just want to break the structure of this world with our hands

00:44:05.240 --> 00:44:14.500
gimon nante nai kono sekai no shikumi wo buchikowashichimae so no te de

00:44:14.540 --> 00:44:24.720
Clear up the fate that befalls me, and then run to the future! Get on!

00:44:14.540 --> 00:44:24.720
furikakaru sadame kirihiraki ima mirai e kakenukero! Get on!

00:44:24.720 --> 00:44:29.600
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:44:29.600 --> 00:44:34.150
With an unknown power second to none,
I will change the direction of the wind

00:44:29.600 --> 00:44:34.150
dare ni mo makenai michi no chikara de kazemuki wo kaero

00:44:34.150 --> 00:44:39.150
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:44:39.150 --> 00:44:47.330
We will face everything before us in our time

00:44:39.150 --> 00:44:47.080
me no mae no subete ni tachimukai oretachi no jidai e

00:44:47.330 --> 00:44:54.170
Burst on the fire

00:45:07.600 --> 00:45:12.730
Reality has been assembled like a nightmare

00:45:07.600 --> 00:45:12.730
akumu no you na kumikomareta genjitsu ni

00:45:12.730 --> 00:45:17.310
Even if we lose our place, and it's filled with shit

00:45:12.730 --> 00:45:17.310
yukiba ushinatte funtsumattemo

00:45:17.310 --> 00:45:22.360
If we never lose the courage to get hurt

00:45:17.310 --> 00:45:22.360
kizutsuku yuuki itsudemo nakusanai nara

00:45:22.360 --> 00:45:26.780
Our answers will not change

00:45:22.360 --> 00:45:26.700
kotae wa kawaranai

00:45:26.780 --> 00:45:36.290
We have no plans; we just want to break inconsistencies in this world

00:45:26.860 --> 00:45:36.290
dasannante nai konosekai no mujun wo buchikowashitai soredake

00:45:36.290 --> 00:45:46.340
Passing through the darkness, release that closed-off future! Get on!

00:45:36.290 --> 00:45:46.340
kurayami wo nukete tozasareta mama no asu wo tokihanate! Get on!

00:45:46.340 --> 00:45:51.140
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:45:51.140 --> 00:45:55.690
Hate, love, and the power of will changes everything

00:45:51.140 --> 00:45:55.690
nikushimi ga ai ga ishi no chikara ga subete wo kaeru

00:45:55.690 --> 00:46:00.730
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:46:00.730 --> 00:46:09.120
A scream of my burning soul seems to burst out of my chest

00:46:00.730 --> 00:46:09.120
mune no oku hajike sou na atsui tamashii no sakebi wo

00:46:09.120 --> 00:46:15.330
Burst on the fire

00:46:20.380 --> 00:46:25.300
The two of us are like stardust; even our words have been stolen

00:46:20.380 --> 00:46:25.300
hoshikuzu you sa futari kotoba sae ubaware

00:46:25.300 --> 00:46:32.050
It's a gray world, a strange reality; there's no hope here, but...

00:46:25.300 --> 00:46:32.050
haiiro no sekai kimyou na genjitsu kibou nado koko ni wa arya shinai dakedo

00:46:34.100 --> 00:46:39.100
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:46:39.100 --> 00:46:43.900
With an unknown power second to none,
I will change the direction of the wind

00:46:39.100 --> 00:46:43.900
dare ni mo makenai michi no chikara de kazemuki wo kaero

00:46:43.900 --> 00:46:48.740
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:46:48.740 --> 00:46:54.660
We will face everything before us in our time

00:46:48.740 --> 00:46:54.620
me no mae no subete ni tachimukai oretachi no jidai e

